tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Can this not be requested from the CanvasItem itself? We really shouldnt be retrieving any data from the RenderingServer","created_at":"2025-10-23T21:38:40Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T21:38:40Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103365#discussion_r2457491578","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103365","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2457491578"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103365#discussion_r2457491578"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103365"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2457491578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":969,"original_line":969,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2457544635","pull_request_review_id":3372955370,"id":2457544635,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6Seye7","diff_hunk":"@@ -966,6 +966,8 @@ class RenderingServerDefault : public RenderingServer {\n \n \tFUNC2(canvas_item_set_visibility_layer, RID, uint32_t)\n \n+\tFUNC1R(uint32_t, canvas_item_get_z_render, RID)","path":"servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.h","commit_id":"953563e4804b1720fad8dd0587c95bd18f48ccba","original_commit_id":"953563e4804b1720fad8dd0587c95bd18f48ccba","user":{"login":"TheSofox","id":3089525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODk1MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3089525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox","html_url":"https://github.com/TheSofox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I covered this topic here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96576#issuecomment-2401164637\r\nThe short version is that the `RenderingServer` is where all the computation happens for sorting out which element is in front of which element (taking into consideration stuff like `show_behind_parent`, `top_level`, `y_sort_enabled` and others).\r\nEither all these calculations are duplicated outside of the `RenderingServer`, we move all these calculations outside of the `RenderingServer`, or we get these values from the `RenderingServer` which is the approach I took.\r\nOf course, you might be suggesting that the `RenderingServer` directly edit the `CanvasItem` to store the values there (Something I considered over a year ago before settling on this solution: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96576#issuecomment-2404938721 ).\r\nIn any event, `RenderingServer` has the code that determines the final order that the items are rendered in, and that is what we need access to. `CanvasItem` doesn't currently have this information.","created_at":"2025-10-23T21:57:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T21:57:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103365#discussion_r2457544635","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103365","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2457544635"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103365#discussion_r2457544635"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103365"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2457544635/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":969,"original_line":969,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2457491578,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]